      "title": "esp: fix conditional logic to avoid uninitialized variables",
      "message": "esp: fix conditional logic to avoid uninitialized variables\n\nThis should fix the error introduced in MR 17703 which causes the\naddr_hex and filter_hex variables ending up uninitialized if there\nis no option selected from the 'Protocol' drop-down in the 'ESP SAs'\nwindow. The default is now IPSEC_SA_UNKNOWN which returns false for\nevery address.\n",
